# {{appNameBase}} SDK - AI Agent Reference

## Installation

Add to your `mix.exs`:

```text
defp deps do
  [
    {:{{packageName}}, "~> {{packageVersion}}"}
  ]
end
```

Then run:

```bash
mix deps.get
```

