### OAuth2 Implicit

The implicit flow obtains the access token out of band (typically in the browser). Pass the token to the authenticator:

```elixir file
defmodule Authentication do
  def client do
    authenticator =
      {{moduleName}}.Auth.OAuth.OAuth2ImplicitAuthenticator.new(
        "https://api.example.com", "client-id", "https://auth.example.com/authorize", [])
      |> {{moduleName}}.Auth.OAuth.OAuth2ImplicitAuthenticator.set_access_token("your-access-token")

    {{moduleName}}.{{clientClassName}}.new(authenticator)
  end
end
```

